            <ArticleTitle>Pediatric hypertension: often missed and mismanaged.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>129-36</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Delayed recognition of hypertension in children can have lasting consequences. The resources detailed here--including Web-based calculators and at-a-glance tables--can facilitate diagnosis and treatment.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
